title: SPIR-V Specification
author: John Kessenich, Google
author: Boaz Ouriel, Intel
author: Raun Krisch, Intel
changes:

=== Changes from Version 1.2

- Moved version number to SPIR-V 1.3

- New functionality:
  * Added subgroup operations:
    ** the <<OpGroupNonUniformElect, *OpGroupNonUniform*>> instructions and <<Capability, capabilities>>.
    ** *Subgroup*-mask <<BuiltIn, built-in decorations>>.
  * Khronos SPIR-V issue #125, #138, #196: Removed capabilities from the <<FP_Rounding_Mode, rounding modes>>.
  * Khronos SPIR-V issue #110: Removed the execution-model restrictions from <<OpControlBarrier, *OpControlBarrier*>>.

- Incorporated the following extensions:
  * SPV_KHR_shader_draw_parameters
  * SPV_KHR_16bit_storage
  * SPV_KHR_device_group
  * SPV_KHR_multiview
  * SPV_KHR_storage_buffer_storage_class
  * SPV_KHR_variable_pointers

- Reserved symbols for
  * SPV_GOOGLE_decorate_string
  * SPV_GOOGLE_hlsl_functionality1
  * SPV_AMD_gpu_shader_half_float_fetch

- Added <<Deprecation, deprecation model>>.
